# G3i Display Feature requirment ---

   ## HP Series identifier for multi-project build (CRB=0, DT800=80, DM800=8, AIO800=81, DM400=4, AIO600=61, NB800=800, NB1000=1000)
   gEfiHpPlatformPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdHpSeries|0|UINT16|0x00000034

   ## HP Project index for multi-project build (CRB=0, Z_01=1, Z_11=11, Z_12=12, Z_21=21, Z_22=22, Z_70=70, Z_90=90, Z_97=97)
   gEfiHpPlatformPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdHpProjectIndex|0|UINT8|0x00000035

   #
   # FFS filename for the Panel EDID override image file. (Example)
   #
#   gEfiHpPlatformPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdExamplePanelEdidOverrideImageFileEdid|{ 0x14, 0x95, 0xe2, 0x74, 0x7e, 0x6, 0xb1, 0x46, 0xb2, 0xef, 0xa3, 0x40, 0x2a, 0x4c, 0x8f, 0x41 }|VOID*|0x00000030

